§§ `Neglect, abandonment, explosives and traps`

-- inputs, in order: 1 I am legally liable to provide my apprentice or servant with necessary food, clothing or lodging | 2 I wilfully refused or neglected to provide it | 3 I had a lawful excuse for refusing or neglecting | 4 my act was unlawful | 5 my act was malicious | 6 I did, or caused, bodily harm to my apprentice or servant | 7 their life was endangered | 8 their health has been or is likely to be permanently injured
